17. Conclusion

AI-TRAVELMATE is designed as an intelligent travel planning system that integrates destination discovery, weather information, route calculations, personalized recommendations, traffic prediction, and AI-assisted explanations.

This SRS establishes the requirements for building and testing the initial MVP using a modular architecture and primarily free or open-source technologies.

The system shall prioritize reliable information, transparent predictions, responsible data usage, maintainability, and a user-friendly travel-planning experience.

Live traffic availability is explicitly treated as a data-source dependency, while traffic prediction is treated as a separate machine learning capability that must be evaluated using appropriate data.